# Applies a design that adds the length `x` and points the child's range at it,
# then a design that replaces `x` with a length in kilometers. The range follows
# `x` and keeps its dimensions.

submodel parent as p

apply range_to_added_length to p
apply readd_kilometers to p

Added length: x_p = x.p
Referenced range: R_p = R_c.p
